      "message": "fix(post): the plasma refusal reads plainly with no machine (#998)\n\nThe engine always publishes a machine object, so with no machine in the\ndocument the name fell back to \"no machine\" and the refusal read \"no\nmachine is not declared a plasma machine\" - a double negative.\n\nSay \"no machine is stated, so none is declared a plasma machine\" instead,\nand pin both wordings in plasma_post_refusals.rs: a mill names itself, a\nmachine-less document says it states none.\n\nFixes #998",
